The '''''Chellatine''-class shuttle''' was a [[transport]] [[Starship|ship]] manufactured by [[Mejson Spaceworks]] in the [[High Republic Era]]. The [[pilot]] [[Nash Durango]] owned a customized ''Chellatine,'' the ''[[Crimson Firehawk]]''.<ref name="SWE" />

